# STIG CD16-00-011100: PostgreSQL must generate audit records when unsuccessful attempts to delete cate
# STIG ID: V-261955 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `pg16-cd16-00-011100-audit-category-delete-fail-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `pg16`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG CD16-00-011100: PostgreSQL must generate audit records when unsuccessful attempts to delete cate`
    description `PostgreSQL must generate audit records when unsuccessful attempts to delete categories of information (e.g., classification levels/security levels) occur.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `pg16,stig,pgaudit,audit,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:CD16-00-011100,NIST-800-53:AU-12`
    control_objective `AU-12`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `dba`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `PostgreSQL16:localhost:pg-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Ensure pgaudit is in shared_preload_libraries and pgaudit.log includes ddl, write, role, and read categories.`

    component_id `comp-pg16-db`

    impl_AU_12 `PostgreSQL implements audit record generation through the pgaudit extension. The shared_preload_libraries parameter is validated to confirm pgaudit is loaded, and pgaudit.log is validated to include the required audit categories (ddl, write, role, read) for comprehensive event logging.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT pg_preload
        parameter `shared_preload_libraries`
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT pg_audit_log
        parameter `pgaudit.log`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE pgaudit_loaded
        found boolean = true
        value string contains `pgaudit`
    STATE_END

    STATE audit_categories
        found boolean = true
        value string contains `ddl`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN pg_config_param
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF pgaudit_loaded
            OBJECT_REF pg_preload
        CTN_END

        CTN pg_config_param
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF audit_categories
            OBJECT_REF pg_audit_log
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
